### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Create appointment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Abebe Kebede",
  "patientEmail": "ABEBE@example.com",
  "patientPhone": "+251911234567",
  "department": "GENERAL_PRACTICE",
  "appointmentDate": "2099-09-02T10:30:00.000Z",
  "symptoms": "Persistent headache for three days"
}

### List
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments

### Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments?department=GENERAL_PRACTICE&isEmergency=false&search=headache

### Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/stats/overview

### Get by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/REPLACE_ID

### Update
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/REPLACE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": "Updated symptoms with enough detail"
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/REPLACE_ID
